          |                Main Menu                   |
          =-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-

          [A] Attack                 [P] Port
          [C] Communications         [B] Black Hole
          [D] Data Base              [F] Fortify Sector
          [I] Your Info              [H] Handle mines
          [L] Look at borders (scan) [O] Orbit Planet
          [T] Launch Torpedo         [M] Move to sector
          [R] Corporation Menu       [Q] Quit game		
